{
  "slug": "sentry-error-assistant",
  "name": "Sentry Error Assistant",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Triage, debug, and fix live Sentry production errors directly inside Claude Code — no browser, no copy-paste, no context switching. Fetches real-time stack traces from your Sentry account, reads your actual source files, and proposes targeted code fixes in one command.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **1 agent**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `fix` (Fetch a specific Sentry issue by ID and propose a targeted code fix), `search` (Search Sentry issues by keyword, error message, or function name), `triage` (List and summarize the top unresolved Sentry production errors for the current project)\n- **Agents** (1): `sentry-debugger` (Specialist agent for deep Sentry error analysis)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `sentry`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sentry-error-assistant@claude-community` from `DhruvTilva/sentry`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
